This repository contains the source code, content, and design for The
ChatShack's website and backend (chatshack.app / api.chatshack.app), a
Cardiff community-run charity providing peer-led mental health support.

The ChatShack name, logo, and branding are the property of The ChatShack.
The site's text content, photography, and the personal stories shared on
it (including the Sleep Out to Help Out story) belong to The ChatShack and
the people who shared them, and may not be reproduced or reused elsewhere
without permission.

No part of this repository - code, design, or content - may be copied,
redistributed, or reused, in whole or in part, without the prior written
permission of Scott Hartley / The ChatShack.

This codebase was built for The ChatShack by Sarah J Hill (Dragon Fire
Design, sarahjhill.com).
